  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPP Production of Honey and Juice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture Beekeeping (Self-help Grant).Beneficiaries: 300 of which 198 are women.This small grant project of honey , juice and honey wine production will help small scale farmers to earn increased income. USADF funds will help 300 people to purchase bee hives,.honey extractors, harvesting bee suits, and assorted processing equipment. Funds will also pay the honey processing training fees and business management training fees.</narrative>
